#: crates/rnote-ui/data/app.metainfo.xml.in.in:203
msgid "improv: inhibit app close while saves are in progress"
msgstr "改善: 保存中はアプリを閉じないように"

#: crates/rnote-ui/data/app.metainfo.xml.in.in:204
msgid ""
"improv: ability to change text selection colors inside a single text box"
msgstr "改善: 1 つのテキストボックス内で選択したテキストの色を変更可能に"

#: crates/rnote-ui/data/app.metainfo.xml.in.in:205
msgid "fix: pen state becoming incorrect on windows (thanks to @Doublonmousse)"
msgstr ""
"修正: Windows でペンの状態が正しくなくなる問題 (@Doublonmousse さんに感謝)"

#: crates/rnote-ui/data/app.metainfo.xml.in.in:206
msgid "fix: file extension filters in dialogs (thanks to @Doublonmousse)"
msgstr ""
"修正: ダイアログでのファイル拡張子のフィルター (@Doublonmousse さんに感謝)"

#: crates/rnote-ui/data/app.metainfo.xml.in.in:207
msgid ""
"fix: force the gtk renderer to gl for now, fixing recurring crashes for some "
"users (thanks to @Doublonmousse)"
msgstr ""
"修正: 当面 GTK のレンダラーを GL に固定し、一部のユーザーで繰り返し発生してい"
"たクラッシュを解消 (@Doublonmousse さんに感謝)"

#: crates/rnote-ui/data/app.metainfo.xml.in.in:208
msgid "fix: two-finger long-press gesture causing crashes for some users"
msgstr ""
"修正: 一部のユーザーで 2 本指の長押しジェスチャーがクラッシュを起こす問題"

#: crates/rnote-ui/data/app.metainfo.xml.in.in:209
msgid "fix: single element stroke not generating hitboxes"
msgstr "修正: 要素が 1 つだけのストロークに当たり判定が生成されない問題"

#: crates/rnote-ui/data/app.metainfo.xml.in.in:210
msgid ""
"fix: scrolls being captured by unit-entries in settings, causing accidental "
"value changes"
msgstr "修正: 設定の単位付き入力欄がスクロールを受け取り、値が誤って変わる問題"

#: crates/rnote-ui/data/app.metainfo.xml.in.in:211
msgid "fix: hover state for typewriter move/resize nodes"
msgstr "修正: 文字ツールの移動/リサイズ用ノードのホバー状態"

#: crates/rnote-ui/data/app.metainfo.xml.in.in:219
msgid ""
"improv: put handles outside of selection borders, enable resizing to smaller "
"sizes (thanks to @Doublonmousse)"
msgstr ""
"改善: ハンドルを選択範囲の枠の外に配置し、より小さくリサイズ可能に "
"(@Doublonmousse さんに感謝)"

#: crates/rnote-ui/data/app.metainfo.xml.in.in:220
msgid ""
"improv: error notification when file operations fail in workspace browser"
msgstr "改善: ワークスペースブラウザーでファイル操作に失敗した際にエラーを通知"

#: crates/rnote-ui/data/app.metainfo.xml.in.in:221
msgid "metainfo: add brand colors (thanks to @bertob)"
msgstr "metainfo: ブランドカラーを追加 (@bertob さんに感謝)"

#: crates/rnote-ui/data/app.metainfo.xml.in.in:222
msgid "fix: origin indicator cross size on hi-dpi screens"
msgstr "修正: 高 DPI の画面での原点マーカーの十字の大きさ"

#: crates/rnote-ui/data/app.metainfo.xml.in.in:223
msgid "fix: rendering got out of sync when resizing long-to-render content"
msgstr "修正: 描画に時間のかかる内容をリサイズすると描画がずれる問題"

#: crates/rnote-ui/data/app.metainfo.xml.in.in:224
msgid "fix: selection stroke widths got larger when resizing non-uniformly"
msgstr "修正: 縦横比を変えてリサイズすると選択範囲のストロークが太くなる問題"

#: crates/rnote-ui/data/app.metainfo.xml.in.in:225
msgid ""
"fix: regression which caused excessive rerendering of selection during "
"resizing"
msgstr "修正: リサイズ中に選択範囲が過剰に再描画される退行"

#: crates/rnote-ui/data/app.metainfo.xml.in.in:233
msgid ""
"fix: importing images changed document dimensions when `adjust-document` pdf "
"import setting is set"
msgstr ""
"修正: PDF のインポート設定 `adjust-document` が有効なとき、画像をインポートす"
"ると文書の寸法が変わる問題"

#: crates/rnote-ui/data/app.metainfo.xml.in.in:234
msgid ""
"fix: windows installer now includes EGL/GLES libraries, fixing launch error "
"when they are present elsewhere but in PATH"
msgstr ""
"修正: Windows のインストーラーに EGL/GLES ライブラリを同梱し、それらが PATH "
"上の別の場所にある場合の起動エラーを解消"

#: crates/rnote-ui/data/app.metainfo.xml.in.in:242
msgid "feat: touch-hold context-menu with basic actions (thanks to @silvasch)"
msgstr ""
"新機能: タッチの長押しで基本操作のコンテキストメニューを表示 (@silvasch さん"
"に感謝)"

#: crates/rnote-ui/data/app.metainfo.xml.in.in:243
msgid "feat: added polygon shape and builder"
msgstr "新機能: 多角形の図形と作成ツールを追加"

#: crates/rnote-ui/data/app.metainfo.xml.in.in:244
msgid ""
"feat: added adjust-document Pdf import option that configures the document "
