#: crates/rnote-ui/data/app.metainfo.xml.in.in:314
msgid "fix: chinese translations (thanks to @detiam)"
msgstr "修正: 中国語の翻訳 (@detiam さんに感謝)"

#: crates/rnote-ui/data/app.metainfo.xml.in.in:315
msgid "fix: single position strokes not being rendered"
msgstr "修正: 1 点だけのストロークが描画されない問題"

#: crates/rnote-ui/data/app.metainfo.xml.in.in:316
