msgstr "アプリのアイコンを調整"

#: crates/rnote-ui/data/app.metainfo.xml.in.in:626
msgid ""
"A new app icon and symbolic! (based on @bertob's design and with his help. "
"Thanks a ton!)"
msgstr ""
"新しいアプリのアイコンとシンボリックアイコン！ (@bertob さんのデザインを元"
